# BuildKit Dockerfile-scoped ignore file for mcubridge-gateway-cpp/Dockerfile.
# Keeps the build context minimal from repository root without affecting
# unrelated Dockerfiles (e.g. build-apk.yml's Dockerfile.apk-feed).
*
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/CMakeLists.txt
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/cmake/
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/cmake/**
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/src/
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/src/**
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/deploy/
!mcubridge-gateway-cpp/deploy/**
!tools/protocol/
!tools/protocol/**
!third_party/pigweed/
!third_party/pigweed/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
